# The mobile workspace stays out of the web upload, except the platform-free
# model catalog and resumable media transport shared with the web app. Gitignore
# semantics cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# contents are excluded level by level and the path down to that folder is
# re-included. Without this the Vercel build fails with "Module not found".
ugc-mobile/*
!ugc-mobile/lib
ugc-mobile/lib/*
!ugc-mobile/lib/model-catalog
!ugc-mobile/lib/media-upload
